Optimal Solution
class Solution:
    def smallestIndex(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:
        n = len(nums)

        for i in range(n):
            num = nums[i]
            digit_sum = 0

            while num > 0:
                digit_sum += num % 10
                num //= 10

            if digit_sum == i:
                return i

        return -1

TC: O(n × d)
SC: O(1)

Flowchart:
Start → n = len(nums) → Traverse i → Calculate digit sum → digit_sum == i? → Return i / Continue → End → Return -1
